   $q$What is the effect of describing the new tenant's window as "bright, and very clean"?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It shows that the speaker is relieved the dusty old shop will finally be cleaned up.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"literal-reading"},{"text":"It suggests that the grandfather had neglected the shop and let it fall into disrepair.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"It contrasts the impersonal new shop with the worn, memory-filled setting, suggesting what will be lost.","is_correct":true},{"text":"It reveals that the speaker plans to work for the new tenant selling phone cases.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It contrasts the impersonal new shop with the worn, memory-filled setting, suggesting what will be lost.$q$, $q$Next to a tape measure "soft as a ribbon from use," the bright, clean window sounds blank and without history. Read in context, the words express loss rather than relief.$q$, 'draft', '2197d1eb-c5c8-5df6-85e4-fdbb2eed36e9')
